[*.]example.edu</string>
      <string id="LoopbackNetworkAllowedForUrlsDesc">Allow sites to make network requests to the local device</string>
      <string id="LoopbackNetworkBlockedForUrls">Block sites from making network requests to the local device</string>
      <string id="LoopbackNetworkBlockedForUrls_Explain">LoopbackNetworkBlockedForUrls

The policy prohibits the specified sites from sending network requests to the local device.

For sources not specified in the policy, the user settings are applied.

If a source is subject to multiple policies, priority is determined in the following order:
- LoopbackNetworkBlockedForUrls
- LoopbackNetworkAllowedForUrls
- LocalNetworkAccessBlockedForUrls
- LocalNetworkAccessAllowedForUrls

