The policy sets a list of URLs that can read files on a device via the File System API.

The policy supersedes DefaultFileSystemReadGuardSetting. The FileSystemReadBlockedForUrls policy supersedes FileSystemReadAskForUrls.

Values

- Not Configured, Disabled: The value of the DefaultFileSystemReadGuardSetting policy is used (if it is set).
- Enabled: The administrator sets the list of URLs. You can use URL templates. The «*» wildcard is only used for subdomains in this form: «[*.]».

For more information about URL templates, see https://yandex.ru/support/browser-corporate/policy/url-patterns.html

Convert non-Latin URLs (for example, яндекс.рф) via punycode: https://www.reg.ru/web-tools/punycode

You can configure it via a file: https://yandex.ru/support/browser-corporate/ru/settings/policy-in-file-config

Example value:

https://www.example.com
[*.]example.edu</string>
